WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,220
general

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:04,830
Are you sure you went to Dongfang Mansion from Maofang?

3
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:07,390
When did I lie to you?

4
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:09,750
Then I'll go in and give it a try. You guys watch me go in and try it.

5
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:15,030
I see you went

6
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,310
Go take a shower quickly

7
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:17,670
I had four portions of cooked rice today

8
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:19,310
I'm going to spit it out, General

9
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,310
you lie

10
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:24,720
If he doesn't work, try again tomorrow.

11
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,840
Maybe you're the only one doing it, right?

12
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,800
I know this shouldn't be said casually.

13
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,760
You Sanzui also knows that General Shenqian has finished dinner and is leaving to eat.

14
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,200
The young general has arrived

15
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,400
Everyone listen to me

16
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,560
It's going to be winter soon

17
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,560
If I don’t get some clothes for everyone,

18
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,800
These people don't say evil

19
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,000
He'll probably freeze to death

20
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,400
After three years of defending the city,

21
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:46,360
We started with a population of 30,000

22
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,000
A large city in the Western Region where traders gather

23
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,560
We were beaten until there were only three hundred of us left.

24
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,120
We all got through this

25
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,280
I know it's not easy

26
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:53,840
Thank you all for your persistence

27
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,680
Today I brought in some rice from outside

28
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,040
Let's all have a good meal

29
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:58,400
The army has retreated now

30
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:59,320
I will think of more ways

31
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,480
Let everyone eat and drink well

32
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,680
At the same time, you have to train your troops well.

33
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:06,110
Thank you, little general. My God.

34
00:01:06,110 --> 00:01:09,270
It's really white rice, not porridge. It has meat.

35
00:01:09,270 --> 00:01:11,710
How long has it been since we had white rice? Look, Qiangzi.

36
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:13,110
We have rice

37
00:01:13,110 --> 00:01:16,030
It's a pity that your mother-in-law can no longer eat mother-in-law

38
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:17,030
Bring the kids to eat

39
00:01:17,030 --> 00:01:18,150
Determined to kill the barbarian living in Lou

40
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:20,070
revenge meat for you

41
00:01:20,070 --> 00:01:23,050
Where does the horse meat come from? When the enemy retreats,

42
00:01:23,050 --> 00:01:25,490
We got three horses and they were all injured, so we killed them and gave them to eat.

43
00:01:25,490 --> 00:01:26,770
Originally it was said that it would be difficult to cook without salt.

44
00:01:26,770 --> 00:01:28,770
Now you even got the salt back and you have rice

45
00:01:28,770 --> 00:01:33,820
Just good enough to eat together

46
00:01:33,820 --> 00:01:35,300
How long have we not had a meal like this?

47
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:36,300
Takeaway for lunch today

48
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,460
Still delicious

49
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:38,740
The taste is really different

50
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:40,780
That should be the meal of immortals, right?

51
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:41,900
Five hundred pounds of rice

52
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:43,020
Let's save some food

53
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:44,540
It can last about two days

54
00:01:44,540 --> 00:01:47,020
Of course the salt can last for half a month.

55
00:01:47,020 --> 00:01:48,380
If only we saved more food

56
00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:49,420
Rice can be eaten for three days

57
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:51,820
You and Liu San will preside over important events here, remember.

58
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:54,780
If you want to cover for me, General, don't worry, you're not here.

59
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:57,380
Liu San and I will take charge of the overall situation. Let's go and rest.
